    "body": "Sorry for going another round on this, but I just realized that @domenic, I, and others have slowly been setting a new style which I think we should try to follow here. It would basically look something like:\n\n``` html\n<p>The ...width... attribute's getter must run these steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n <li><p>If this <code>ImageBitMap</code> object's [[<span>Detached</span>]] internal slot's value is\n true, then return 0.</p></li>\n\n <li><p>Return this <code>ImageBitmap</code> object's width, in ...CSS pixels....</p></li>\n</ol>\n```\n",
